{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-0123-defa-345678901234",
    "name": "Nurses CRUD (Multi-DB)",
    "description": "# Nurses API\n\nCRUD for diagnostic `nurse` with multi-branch sync, master/EMR user provisioning (role_id=2), and status/password helpers.\n\n## Auth\n- Header: `API-KEY` (required)\n- Body/query: `token`, `requester`\n\n## Request body format\n- **GET** — query params\n- **POST** — **multipart form-data**\n\n## Diagnostic nurse sync\nCreate/update/delete/change_status/change_password sync `nurse` across:\n- `master` (0), `mobile` (1), `oakridge` (2), `mactan` (3), `consolacion` (4), `mantlewood` (7)\n\nConsistency check on create/update. Mismatch: `Data inconsistency detected between master and {branch}.`\n\n## Master user\n- `email` = nurse `username`\n- `role_id` = **2**\n- `branch_id` = comma-separated `branch_in`\n\n## EMR user sync\n`branch_in` is comma-separated (e.g. `1,2,4`). EMR user created/updated on each mapped EMR DB with:\n- `master_doctor_id` = nurse id (existing EMR column)\n- `role_id` = **2**\n- `role_name` from Oakridge EMR role id 2\n\nOn update, EMR users on DBs no longer in `branch_in` are soft-deleted.\n\n## Methods\n`get`, `create`, `update`, `delete`, `change_status`, `change_password`\n\nNo consultations, signature, get_type, or get_specilization.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost/cpci-business-ops-api" },
    { "key": "api_key", "value": "clinicaRiKOYqlwdTJ-lNedqS0k-it!395!-6ls1JXM7Vcc" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}" },
    { "key": "requester", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
